name: sim.getObjectParent
description: Retrieves the handle of an object's parent object
luaSynopsis: int parentHandle = sim.getObjectParent(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int parentHandle = sim.getObjectParent(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
outputs:
1. parentHandle: handle of parent or -1 if the parent doesn't exist
